      "motion": "Commissioner Kemp made a motion to recommend approval of item 2B the request for a zone change for planned development residential to planned development commercial on 1 acre and a zone change from agricultural A-1 to PD residential on approximately 7.98 acres, with the following conditions 1. Any project that is ultimately approved for construction meets the new water ordinance that is pending, meets all parts of that code. 2. Any signage, we approve the 15 feet, but any signage will need to, lighting of the signage and the design need further approval by City Staff and the recommendations from City staff as detailed in the proposal.",
